{"place_name":"臨沮縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"临沮县","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"a5597031-db0e-11ef-9e58-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊山","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆山","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"a5597032-db0e-11ef-b8a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"枝江縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"枝江县","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"a5597033-db0e-11ef-af3e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳曰：江、漢、沮、漳，楚之望也。水經：沮水出漢中房陵，東南過臨沮界，又東過枝江縣，南入于江。漳水出臨沮縣東荊山，南至枝江縣北入于沮。二水上下皆蠻所居也。沮，子余翻。漳，諸良翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传曰：江、汉、沮、漳，楚之望也。水经：沮水出汉中房陵，东南过临沮界，又东过枝江县，南入于江。漳水出临沮县东荆山，南至枝江县北入于沮。二水上下皆蛮所居也。沮，子余翻。漳，诸良翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"a5597024-db0e-11ef-93da-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏安郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥安郡","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a5597037-db0e-11ef-bdeb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長寧縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"长宁县","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a5597038-db0e-11ef-9813-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"a5597039-db0e-11ef-982c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長寧","place_name_jianti_auto":"长宁","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"a559703a-db0e-11ef-85f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長林","place_name_jianti_auto":"长林","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"a559703b-db0e-11ef-ac42-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"綏安郡，治長寧縣，隋省長寧入長林。","note_content_jianti_auto":"绥安郡，治长宁县，隋省长宁入长林。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"a5597036-db0e-11ef-8728-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"a5597022-db0e-11ef-9c81-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"pén","source_anchor_text":"敷馮該戍湓口移沮漳","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":48,"text":"湓","tongjian_id":"cbb9f387-f3cc-5ca4-b4d6-49d9d6be4152"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沮","place_name_jianti_auto":"沮","resolved_place_entity_id":4865,"start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"a5597046-db0e-11ef-80f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷七十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"玄败，其党桓谦匿于柤中，复作乱。盖沮中水陆纡险，蛮蛋错处...","context_before":"...化，欲令郡兵临江迎援。诏荆州都督王基径造沮水迎之，不果。","source_end_index":797,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a71ab516-1a9c-5d37-ad80-e22ec321d13f","source_start_index":747,"source_text":"晋隆安五年，桓玄移沮漳蛮二千余户于江南立武宁郡[治编县]，更招集流民立绥安郡[治长宁，俱见荆门州]。"},{"context_after":"元兴三年，刘毅等讨桓振于江陵，自寻阳西上，至夏口，败振党...","context_before":"...切也。隆安二年，桓玄为江州刺史，移屯夏口，以逼江陵襄阳。","source_end_index":1004,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c1f1d4b7-3617-565d-b543-e0885b2bf0a3","source_start_index":982,"source_text":"五年，玄镇江陵，表其兄伟为江州刺史，镇夏口。"}],"path":"湖广方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷七十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、九江府（卷八十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"元兴三年，桓玄自建康败奔寻阳，留其党何澹之等守湓口，西还...","context_before":"...期、桓玄奄至湓口，江州刺史王愉惶遽奔临川，玄遣军追获之。","source_end_index":264,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d0497596-2a78-507c-950f-7e62e6e8adb3","source_start_index":244,"source_text":"五年，桓玄镇江陵，遣其将皇甫敷等戍湓口。"}],"path":"江西方舆纪要/四、九江府（卷八十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"25桓玄表其兄偉爲江州刺史，鎭夏口；司馬刁暢爲輔國將軍、督八郡軍事，鎭襄陽；遣其將皇甫敷、馮該戍湓口。移沮、漳蠻二千戶于江南，立武寧郡；更招集流民，立綏安郡。詔徵廣州刺史刁逵、豫章太守郭昶之，玄皆留不遣。","content_fanyi":"东晋荆州刺史桓玄向朝廷上表，请求任命他的哥哥桓伟为江州刺史，镇守夏口；任命司马刁畅担任辅国将军、督八郡军事，镇守襄阳；并派部将皇甫敷、冯该戍守湓口。随后，他强行把沮水、漳水一带的二千户蛮族居民迁往长江以南，设置武宁郡；再招集四方流亡的饥民，增设绥安郡。朝廷下诏征召广州刺史刁逵、豫章太守郭昶之入京，桓玄将二人全部扣留，不许他们前往。","content_jianti_auto":"25桓玄表其兄伟为江州刺史，镇夏口；司马刁畅为辅国将军、督八郡军事，镇襄阳；遣其将皇甫敷、冯该戍湓口。移沮、漳蛮二千户于江南，立武宁郡；更招集流民，立绥安郡。诏征广州刺史刁逵、豫章太守郭昶之，玄皆留不遣。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":10017,"number":25,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百一十二 (晉紀三十四) / 安皇帝丁 / 隆安五年 / 第 45 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"a5597022-db0e-11ef-9c81-a0d3651f611f","year_int":401},"tongjian_id":"a5597022-db0e-11ef-9c81-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"沮","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"王世充","people_name_jianti_auto":"王世充","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b7034c21-db0e-11ef-9d66-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"王世充","people_name_jianti_auto":"王世充","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"b7034c22-db0e-11ef-b7cf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄州","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄州","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b7034c23-db0e-11ef-86eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南漳縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"南漳县","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b7034c24-db0e-11ef-819b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b7034c25-db0e-11ef-b988-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沮州","place_name_jianti_auto":"沮州","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b7034c26-db0e-11ef-acf0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南漳","place_name_jianti_auto":"南漳","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b7034c27-db0e-11ef-a768-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b7034c28-db0e-11ef-92e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨沮縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"临沮县","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b7034c29-db0e-11ef-8782-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b7034c2a-db0e-11ef-ac54-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沮州","place_name_jianti_auto":"沮州","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b7034c2b-db0e-11ef-8419-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢南縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉南县","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"b7034c2c-db0e-11ef-b481-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"b7034c2d-db0e-11ef-be99-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"華山郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"华山郡","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"b7034c2e-db0e-11ef-abac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"西魏","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b7034c2f-db0e-11ef-8c2f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"b7034c30-db0e-11ef-8239-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"華州","place_name_jianti_auto":"华州","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"b7034c31-db0e-11ef-84ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢南縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉南县","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"b7034c32-db0e-11ef-9efe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"b7034c33-db0e-11ef-9ff6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宜城","place_name_jianti_auto":"宜城","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"b7034c34-db0e-11ef-8e8b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"襄州南漳縣，後周置沮州。南漳，漢之臨沮縣也。隋廢沮州。蓋王世充復置。漢南縣，宋置華山郡，西魏廢郡，王世充蓋取宋郡名而置華州也。漢南縣，唐貞觀八年省倂入宜城。沮，子魚翻。華，戶化翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"襄州南漳县，后周置沮州。南漳，汉之临沮县也。隋废沮州。盖王世充复置。汉南县，宋置华山郡，西魏废郡，王世充盖取宋郡名而置华州也。汉南县，唐贞观八年省倂入宜城。沮，子鱼翻。华，户化翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b7034c20-db0e-11ef-9c17-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沮","place_name_jianti_auto":"沮","place_note":"湖北省南津县","resolved_place_entity_id":4865,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b7034c37-db0e-11ef-bec6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"64戊子，安撫大使李大亮取王世充沮、華二州。","content_fanyi":"戊子，也就是十一月二十九日，唐安抚大使李大亮攻取王世充的沮州、华州二州。","content_jianti_auto":"64戊子，安抚大使李大亮取王世充沮、华二州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18170,"number":64,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十八 (唐紀四) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝中之上 / 三年 / 第 79 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"b7034c1f-db0e-11ef-8fec-a0d3651f611f","year_int":620},"tongjian_id":"b7034c1f-db0e-11ef-8fec-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":2},"place_name":"沮"},"message":"success","success":true}